<title>UK: Williams up as Kleinwort repeats &quot;buy&quot;.</title>
<headline>Williams up as Kleinwort repeats &quot;buy&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Williams Holdings Plc rose on Tuesday as analysts at Dresdner Kleinwort Benson issued a &quot;buy&quot; recommendation on the stock, dealers said.</p>
<p>Shares in the fire protection and security products group were up 3p at 318-1/2 by 1101 GMT in active trade of 4.1 million shares.</p>
<p>Sources said the Kleinwort argued the stock was undervalued and took a positive view on the 1.3 billion stg acquisition of Chubb Security Plc, announced in February.</p>
<p>Analysts at the brokerage were not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
